message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Reproducible field experiment: confirmed-state access latency in a permissioned Avalanche L1"
abstract: >-
  Protocol, software and reference dataset for measuring T_visible, the time
  from submitting a signed transaction until the first independent read node
  returns the accepted updated state, across five block-production profiles,
  three topologies and five offered loads on a two-site cyber range. The
  package contains the executable protocol, the measurement client, a
  documented reference model, the full statistical plan with paired bootstrap
  confidence intervals, pre-registered stability rules, and every table and
  figure of the accompanying article.
